{"id":"23e6be89fc7cf486","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations.md","title":"遗传递归运算 HRO","display":"df-hereditarily-recursive-operations — 遗传递归运算 HRO","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations","aliases":["72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations"],"display":"df-hereditarily-recursive-operations — 遗传递归运算 HRO","depends_on":["[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §3.3(ii), print430–431/PDF442–443","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source clauses and type-recursion well-definedness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditarily-recursive-operations — 遗传递归运算 HRO"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §3.3(ii), print430–431/PDF442–443"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source clauses and type-recursion well-definedness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r\">\\(\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a>；固定编号、数值配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 及逆投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0,p_1\">\\(p_0,p_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\)</span>。下式按类型树定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=\\omega,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}&amp;:=\\{z\\in\\omega:p_0(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\land p_1(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\ \\exists b\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\mathbf n}&amp;:=\\omega,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}&amp;:=\\{z\\in\\omega:p_0(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\land p_1(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\ \\exists b\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数类型仅要求在指定输入载体上全定义并落入指定输出载体。等号仍是数码相等；两个不同程序即使逐点相同也不是同一个 HRO 数码。结构递归的每步调用严格子类型；未要求对不属于输入类型的所有自然数都停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r$ 取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；固定编号、数值配对 $p$ 及逆投影 $p_0,p_1$ 取 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。下式按类型树定义 $\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r$ 取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]；固定编号、数值配对 $p$ 及逆投影 $p_0,p_1$ 取 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。下式按类型树定义 $\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{RT},\\mathbf n,\\times_r,\\Rightarrow_r","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p_0,p_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\mathbf n}&:=\\omega,\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}&:=\\{z\\in\\omega:p_0(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\land p_1(z)\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{HRO}_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}&:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\sigma\\ \\exists b\\in\\operatorname{HRO}_\\tau\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1850,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-514","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recu